        436.71087646484375,
        298.63140869140625
      ],
      "text": "5.1.1\t Screening for TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 15.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4497680664062,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Research gaps relating to TB screening among people living with HIV are listed below. A more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.3817138671875,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "comprehensive list of research priorities on TB screening can be found in the consolidated guidelines",
