      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        165.8251953125,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "on TB screening  . (12)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.4100341796875,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Well-designed clinical trials are needed on the accuracy, effectiveness (including the impact",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4021606445312,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "on patient-important outcomes such as mortality), feasibility and cost implications of using the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3881225585938,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "W4SS, CRP, CXR and mWRD to screen for TB across all HIV subpopulations in settings with low,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        409.3824157714844,
        454.5668640136719,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "medium and high burdens of HIV and TB with and without high ART coverage.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4220581054688,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Sub-populations of people living with HIV for whom further investigation is required would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.4021606445312,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "include, but not be limited to, inpatients, acute care service attendees, people with ART treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4046020507812,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "failure, people newly diagnosed with HIV and enrolling in ART clinics, people living with HIV who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        465.3824157714844,
        527.3880004882812,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "are clinically stable and established on ART, pregnant women, and children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        479.3824157714844,
        156.534912109375,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        493.3824157714844,
        527.4285888671875,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Evaluation is needed of the accuracy and effectiveness of complete screening and diagnostic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.400146484375,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "algorithms, including symptom screening, CXR, CRP and mWRDs used in various combinations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.3946533203125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with diagnostic evaluation. Research into their effectiveness should include measures of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        535.3824462890625,
        463.790283203125,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "impacts on patient-important outcomes, such as mortality and treatment success.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        78.23609924316406,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4384155273438,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "More data are needed on the effectiveness, cost-effectiveness, feasibility and acceptability,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.3847045898438,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "frequency and optimal periodicity of routine, regular screening with the W4SS, CRP, CXR and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        577.3823852539062,
        265.54278564453125,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "mWRD among people living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        78.23609924316406,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.435302734375,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Evaluation is needed of the accuracy and predictive value of measuring CRP above any cut-off",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.4186401367188,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "higher than 5 mg/L for TB screening in settings with different TB prevalences, when it is used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        619.3823852539062,
        351.9070739746094,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "either alone or in combination with other screening tests.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        78.23609924316406,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4385375976562,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Studies that explore the optimal placement of mWRDs for screening in antenatal care settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        647.3823852539062,
        282.6807556152344,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "versus within ART clinics are also needed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        78.23609924316406,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.426513671875,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Assessments of the potential for screening of people living with HIV with mWRDs using specimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4000244140625,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "other than sputum are needed. Further evidence is also required about the performance of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.418701171875,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "CAD software stratified according to the characteristics of the individual being evaluated (e.g.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.439697265625,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "by smear status, HIV status, age cohort, history of TB, smoking status, sex) to allow for better",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        717.3823852539062,
        381.912841796875,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "setting-specific and patient-specific calibration of CAD software.",
